- ## Which receivers can be drained
+ ## Qué receptores admiten la conversión

- Only a receiver with a `Countable` instance has an `extent`, and only one with an
- `Applicable` instance can be read with an ordinal. A loop over anything else has no confined
- form and is left alone. The receivers that come up:
+ Solo un receptor con una instancia `Countable` tiene un `extent`, y solo uno con una instancia
+ `Applicable` se puede leer con un ordinal. Un bucle sobre cualquier otra cosa no tiene forma
+ confinada y se deja como está. Los receptores que aparecen:

= form and is left alone. The receivers that come up:
=
